WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.270
Two egg-shaped strips of land
face each other across a bay.

2
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.740
On one, white palaces.

3
00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:09.550
On the other, a turreted mansion.

4
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.030
Between them and the
city lies a grey plain.

5
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.640
"This is a valley of ashes".

6
00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:17.880
Above it looms a billboard.

7
00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:21.230
A golden key tries the
door of the white house.

8
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:22.990
It will not turn.

9
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.720
Gatsby has the mansion and the money.

10
00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:28.240
So why can't he join East Egg?

11
00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:32.160
In this mission, you'll read
four places as a class map.

12
00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:35.890
You'll weigh old money against
new, in the years of Prohibition,

13
00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:38.880
from 1920 to 1933.

14
00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:43.480
And you'll look into the valley,
and ask who pays the price.

15
00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:47.740
Your mission: explain why
Gatsby can't join East Egg.
